<title>UK: Rheinische Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rheinische Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Commerzbank, ABN AMRO Hoare Govett,</p>
<p>Bayerische Vereinsbank, Deutsche Bank and Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    19.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.125    PAY DATE   *20.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.50 BP  LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	*INTEREST PERIOD STARTS 19.JAN.97 WITH ONE DAY</p>
<p>		 ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  22.50 BP  PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
